===============================================================================
2. DATA - Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International
===============================================================================

Applies to everything under data/, that is the two evaluation sets released
with the article:

  data/jakob_math/       and  data/jakob_math_eval/   134 handwritten
                                                      mathematical expressions
  data/jakob_text_v2/                                 100 German handwritten
                                                      text lines

together with their ground-truth transcriptions.

Licensed under CC BY-NC 4.0:  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

You may share and adapt this material for non-commercial purposes, provided you
give appropriate credit and indicate whether changes were made. Cite the article
above when you use these sets.

The crops are handwritten annotations made by Prof. Dr. Judith Jakob on her own
lecture slides, released with her permission for research use. The
non-commercial term reflects the scope of that permission. Enquiries about uses
outside it should go to the authors.


===============================================================================
3. THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
===============================================================================

TAMER/ is a git submodule pointing at https://github.com/qingzhenduyu/TAMER and
is not covered by either licence above. It remains under its own upstream terms.

Model checkpoints obtained at runtime from third parties, among them
Qwen/Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct, microsoft/trocr-large-handwritten,
PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR-VL-1.5, ds4sd/SmolDocling-256M-preview and the
Ultralytics YOLO weights, are each governed by their own licences. This
repository redistributes none of them.
